    "enUS": {
      "description": "Your orders are simple-- Go into the dungeons beneath the keep and find Commander Folkar. Free him if he lives, and learn what you can about what in the twisting nether is going on here.\r\n\r\nThere's an army waiting for you down there and you won't survive on your own. I hope you have allies... preferably strong ones.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Find Commander Folkar",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Enter the Alcaz Prison and find Commander Folkar.",
      "title": "No Orc Left Behind",
